{
 "_comment": "The engine .plg set: one row per engine. Sources are relative to synth-open/. opt: engines = the flavour's OpenTracker module flags, o3 = the flavour's FM4 / B-Type flags, anything else = literal flags. extra = more flags of the DSP source only. name = the descriptor name and the SYNTH_ENGINES name in synth-open/engines.mk (-DSYNTH_ENGINE_<name>). stored, patch, type = the numbers of the engine (plug_abi.h PLUG_SYNTH_MANIFEST). version = the .plg header version, bump it when that engine's bytes change on purpose.",
